gagement & recognition Engagement & recognition Changemaker Awards Changemaker Awards Changemaker Award Nominations - Employees Peacock Awards Service awards Creating an engaging employee experience Human rights and accessibility Human rights and accessibility Accessibility Accessibility Our commitment to accessibility Resources for staff & faculty Staff profile: Donneil McNab Video & transcript President's Steering Committee on Equity, Diversity & Inclusion Reporting on diversity Get involved Indigenous engagement Volunteering & giving Volunteering & giving Donating blood United Way at Royal Roads United Way at Royal Roads United Way prize options Meet the United Way committee United Way events Your impact Your impact Donation matching with United Way Seeking a new United Way campaign chair United Way news Our university Top Header Menu Programs & courses Admission Current students Resource catalogue Crossroads Departments Careers Forms RoyalRoads.ca Log in Search Breadcrumb Home Careers Careers Why work at RRU Staff / faculty opportunities Associate faculty / contractor opportunities How to apply Employment opportunities What RRU can offer your career Whether you join RRU as an employee or an independent contractor, we foster a work environment that mirrors the same philosophy and values we offer our learners: inspiring people with the courage to transform the world by being caring, creative and bold in all we do. You'll feel welcome here. RRU is committed to being a catalyst for equity, diversity and inclusion. We also take our search for talent very seriously, striving to create the best experience possible for all employees. In this section Employment opportunities Browse RRU employment opportunities for faculty and staff positions, as well as well as associate faculty and other contractor positions. Contractor opportunities Search contract opportunities to join Royal Roads University as an associate faculty member or academic contractor. How to apply Follow these step-by-step instructions to apply for staff and faculty positions as well as associate faculty and jobs at Royal Roads University. Why work at RRU You'll love working here. We strive to ensure the best experience possible for Royal Roads University staff, faculty, associate faculty and contractors. Contact us about careers at RRU 250.391.2600 ext 4408 250.391.2570 Fax We'd be happy to answer your questions about careers at Royal Roads University. Email us @ Royal Roads Location 2005 Sooke Road Victoria, BC  V9B 5Y2 Canada Campus map Contact Phone: 250.391.2511 Toll-free: 1.800.788.8028 Contact directory Popular links Careers Campus Security IT Services Multimedia Services Webmail Policies Follow us Facebook Instagram Linkedin Youtube © 2026 Royal Roads University | Footer Website feedback"
