eedom of Information and Protection of Privacy Act.  Your personal information is/will be used to document, manage and administer the employer-employee relationship, including the performance and development planning (PDP) process, and will be confidentially and consequently shared with our contracted services provider managing this performance management software and will not be disclosed to any other external third parties unless we are directed to do so by you.  If you are applying to multiple positions, your application and attached documents may be viewed by members of Hiring Committees for all of the applied to positions.  Any documents in the My Attachments section are viewable by the hiring managers for any positions you have applied to.  For more information regarding the collection and use of your personal information please contact Royal Road’s University’s Privacy Officer at (250) 391-2600 (Extension 4178) or via regular mail at 2005 Sooke Road, Victoria, BC V9B 5Y2 This site conforms to the Double Opt-in policy . This is to prevent fraud, such as a person using another person's email address. Once you complete this account creation process, a notification will be sent to the email address entered and you will be required to confirm your email address by clicking the hyperlink in the notification. Please be aware that you will not be able to continue the process you started until you have verified your email address. Upload Résumé First Name First Name is a required field and should be completed. Middle Name Last Name Last Name is a required field and should be completed. Password Password is a required field and should be completed. Confirm Password Confirm Password is a required field and should be completed. IE_password_confirm Referral Source Referral Source is a required field and should be completed. -- Select -- Advertisement-TV Advertisement-Print Employee Referral Friend/Word of Mouth CareerBuilder.com HotJobs.com Job Fair Monster Job Board Our 