ation. I understand that  Royal Roads University will seek my permission prior to verifying any information included in this application and facts resulting from the enquiries.  Royal Roads University is subsequently authorized to use any information obtained from its enquiries to determine my suitability for employment. I release Royal Roads University from any liability in connection with the enquiry process . I hereby authorize any former employer or any other person given as references (unless otherwise noted) to answer any questions that may be asked. If employed, I agree to abide by the policies, procedures, rules and regulations of Royal Roads University. Unless otherwise specified in writing, I understand that nothing contained in this employment application or in the granting of an interview is intended to create an employment contract between Royal Roads University and myself for either employment or for the providing of any benefit. I understand that if subsequent to this application, I am employed by Royal Roads University that both Royal Roads University and I have read and do understand this company's intent that any employment relationship established between this company and myself will be on a mutually agreed basis. I understand that submission of this resume does not obligate Royal Roads University in any way. Scroll to the bottom of the Terms of Use section in order to enable the acknowledgment checkbox so that you can proceed. By checking this box I hereby agree to the Terms of Use. By checking this box I hereby agree to the Terms of Use. Continue Cancel v18.5.3 Last sync: 2026-09-03 04:00:09 Our Location 2005 Sooke Road Victoria, BC V9B 5Y2 Canada Campus Map Get In Touch Phone: 250.391.2511 Toll-free: 1.800.788.8028 E-mail Us Directories Twitter FaceBook LinkedIn YouTube Pinterest Privacy Policy Academic Regulations Copyright 2026 © Royal Roads University Back to top × Close"
